function enemyIntent(e){if(e.intent)return e.intent;const heroes=livingHeroes(),special=(enemyHasRole(e,'Caster')||enemyHasRole(e,'Boss'))&&((e.actionsTaken||0)+1)%3===0;if(special)return e.intent={kind:'aoe',label:enemyHasRole(e,'Boss')?'Sweeping Ruin':'Arcane Burst',targetName:'All heroes',damageType:'magical'};const taunter=heroes.find(h=>h.tauntRounds>0),target=taunter||threatTarget(heroes),execute=enemyHasRole(e,'Predator')&&target.hp/target.maxHp<.3,enrage=enemyHasRole(e,'Bruiser')&&e.hp/e.maxHp<.3,mult=(execute?1.35:1)*(enrage?1.4:1),defense=e.damageType==='magical'?heroSheetStats(target).mdef:heroSheetStats(target).def,estimate=Math.max(1,Math.round(e.atk*mult*100/(100+defense*3)));return e.intent={kind:'attack',label:execute?'Execute':enrage?'Enraged Attack':'Attack',targetId:target.id,targetName:target.name,damageType:e.damageType,estimate}}
